Aim

To develop an online fashion shopping system for browsing, purchasing, and tracking clothing, footwear, and accessories.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Browse categories and search for fashion products.
View product details, sizes, and availability.
Add products to the cart and proceed to checkout.
Make payment and track the order status.
Admin manages products, categories, prices, and customer details.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online fashion shopping system was designed to manage product browsing, shopping cart operations, purchases, and order tracking efficiently.
